title: Campus_Enter
---
<<if not flagged("campus_intro")>>
    Dex: The main quad at sunset. A stage, a statue, and a hundred people cooler than me.
    Roxy Vale: Talent Round tonight, people! Bring your talent and your partner!
    Dex: I have neither. Great start.
    <<flag campus_intro>>
<<endif>>
===

title: CampusDorm_Look
---
Dex: My dorm. Room 214 is up there somewhere, missing me.
===
title: CampusDorm_Use
---
<<go dorm_hallway from_stairs>>
===

title: LibraryDoor_Look
---
Dex: The library. Open late, for people with ambition. Or nowhere else to go.
===
title: LibraryDoor_Use
---
<<go library from_campus>>
===

title: Statue_Look
---
<<if flagged("statue_shades")>>
    Dex: Our founder, Augustus Plumworth, looking slightly less cool without the shades.
<<else>>
    Dex: Founder Augustus Plumworth. Somebody put a pair of sunglasses on his head. He looks amazing.
<<endif>>
===
title: Statue_Use
---
<<if flagged("statue_shades")>>
    Dex: Sorry, Augustus. You looked better in them anyway. Wait, no, I mean, you look great.
<<else>>
    Dex: The sunglasses are way out of reach. I'd need to knock them down with something.
<<endif>>
===
title: Statue_Frisbee
---
<<if flagged("statue_shades")>>
    Dex: He's got nothing left to lose.
<<else>>
    Dex: Frisbee, don't fail me now.
    Dex: Bonk! The shades flip off his head... and land right in my hand. The frisbee lands on the stage roof.
    <<take frisbee>>
    <<give sunglasses>>
    <<flag statue_shades>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Frisbee_Look
---
Dex: Somebody's frisbee, abandoned on the grass. Neon orange. Very aerodynamic.
===
title: Frisbee_Use
---
Dex: Finders keepers. Again.
<<give frisbee>>
<<flag took_frisbee>>
===

title: Kiosk_Look
---
Dex: A kiosk covered in flyers, with a campus map on the side.
===
title: Kiosk_Use
---
-> Take a Talent Round flyer <<if not flagged("took_flyer")>>
    Dex: "TALENT ROUND TONIGHT. Contestants need a talent and a partner." Subtle.
    <<give flyer>>
    <<flag took_flyer>>
-> Read the campus map
    <<jump Campus_Map>>
-> Think about what to do next
    <<jump A1_Hint>>
-> Never mind
===
title: Campus_Map
---
Dex: Where to?
-> Greek Row <<if current_act() >= 2>>
    <<go greek_row from_campus>>
-> Science Hall <<if current_act() >= 3>>
    <<go science_hall from_campus>>
-> Downtown <<if current_act() >= 4>>
    <<go downtown from_campus>>
-> Uptown <<if current_act() >= 5>>
    <<go uptown from_campus>>
-> The TV studio <<if current_act() >= 6>>
    <<go tv_studio from_campus>>
-> Stay here
    <<if current_act() < 2>>
        Dex: Everywhere else on the map can wait. Tonight, it's the Talent Round.
    <<endif>>
===

title: Stage_Look
---
Dex: The Speed Daters Live audition stage. Lights, banners, and a terrifying lack of places to hide.
===
title: Stage_Use
---
<<jump Roxy_Talk>>
===

title: Roxy_Look
---
Dex: Roxy Vale. Host of Speed Daters Live. Her smile has its own lighting crew.
===
title: Roxy_Talk
---
<<if current_act() >= 2>>
    <<jump Roxy_NextRound>>
<<elseif flagged("won_ivy")>>
    <<jump Act1_TalentRound>>
<<elseif not flagged("signed_up")>>
    Roxy Vale: Hi, sweetie! You're not on my list. Contestants sign the sheet in their dorm lounge.
    Roxy Vale: And bring proof you're a catch. A reference, a trophy, a restraining order that expired. Anything.
<<elseif not flagged("met_roxy")>>
    Roxy Vale: Dex Dooley, room 214! The guy with the cowboy hat!
    Roxy Vale: Here's the deal, lover boy. Every contestant performs in the Talent Round with a partner.
    Roxy Vale: Show me someone who'll get up on this stage with you, and show me your talent.
    Dex: My talent is... uh... I'll get back to you.
    <<flag met_roxy>>
<<else>>
    Roxy Vale: No partner, no performance! Find somebody brave enough to share the spotlight.
<<endif>>
<<jump A1_Roxy_Menu>>
===
title: A1_Roxy_Menu
---
-> Ask about Speed Daters Live
    Roxy Vale: Five rounds, one night, a live final on national TV. We find love, lover boy. Or at least ratings.
    <<jump A1_Roxy_Menu>>
-> Ask what counts as a talent <<if flagged("signed_up")>>
    Roxy Vale: Juggling, singing, poetry, an emotional monologue about your car. Last year a guy just yelled. He came third.
    <<jump A1_Roxy_Menu>>
-> Ask where to find a partner <<if flagged("signed_up")>>
    <<if flagged("met_ivy")>>
        Dex: (Ivy writes poetry. If she could only face a crowd...)
        Roxy Vale: Whoever you're thinking of right now, lover boy, go get them.
    <<else>>
        Roxy Vale: Look for the person who'd never volunteer. They're always the showstoppers.
        Roxy Vale: Try the library. Nobody ever looks in the library.
    <<endif>>
    <<jump A1_Roxy_Menu>>
-> Ask about the hat <<if has("cowboy_hat")>>
    Roxy Vale: Proof that a real cowgirl likes you. The cameras are going to eat that up. Never take it off.
    <<jump A1_Roxy_Menu>>
-> Ask if she's nervous <<if flagged("signed_up")>>
    Roxy Vale: Honey, I was born on live TV. Literally. My mom was a contestant. She came second.
    <<jump A1_Roxy_Menu>>
-> Head off
    Roxy Vale: Go get 'em, lover boy!
===
title: Roxy_Token
---
<<if current_act() >= 2>>
    Roxy Vale: Keep your souvenirs, lover boy. You've already proven yourself.
<<elseif flagged("won_ivy")>>
    <<jump Act1_TalentRound>>
<<else>>
    Roxy Vale: Cute. Now find a partner for the Talent Round.
<<endif>>
===
title: Act1_TalentRound
---
Roxy Vale: Ladies and gentlemen, the Talent Round! Please welcome Dex Dooley and Ivy!
Ivy: (in sunglasses, notebook open) "Ode to the Quiet Kid in the Back Row." By me. Nobody else. Me.
Ivy: "You think I'm not listening. I am listening. I am listening so hard."
Dex: And I... do an interpretive dance. Of the poem. In a cowboy hat.
Dex: It's terrible. It's glorious. Somebody in the crowd is crying. I think it's me.
Percival Thorne: (from the back) ...Derivative. (sniffs) Beautifully derivative.
Roxy Vale: Folks, I have never seen anything like that, and I hope I never do again! They're through!
Roxy Vale: Next up: Greek Week. The Quiz Round is on Greek Row, so get to know some people, lover boy!
Ivy: That was the scariest and best thing I've ever done. Keep the bookmark. Go win this.
<<flag act1_done>>
<<act 2>>
Dex: Act One, done. Greek Row is on the campus map now.
===
title: Roxy_NextRound
---
<<if current_act() == 2>>
    Roxy Vale: The Quiz Round is on Greek Row, lover boy. The campus map will take you there.
<<elseif current_act() == 3>>
    Roxy Vale: The Dare Round is over at Science Hall. Bring your goggles!
<<elseif current_act() == 4>>
    Roxy Vale: The Date Round is Downtown. Wear something that isn't that shirt.
<<elseif current_act() == 5>>
    Roxy Vale: The Finals are Uptown! Only the best of the best, lover boy.
<<else>>
    Roxy Vale: Studio's open! The grand finale of Speed Daters Live is tonight!
<<endif>>
===

title: Item_pen_Look
---
Dex: A pen on a snapped string, liberated from the sign-up sheet.
===
title: Item_flyer_Look
---
Dex: "TALENT ROUND TONIGHT. Contestants need a talent and a partner." Lots of blank space on the back.
===
title: Combine_Pen_Flyer
---
Dex: On the back of the flyer I write: "Hi. I'm Dex. You look like someone with a secret talent. Want to be my partner tonight? Circle YES or YES."
<<take flyer>>
<<give note_for_ivy>>
<<flag wrote_note>>
===
title: Item_note_for_ivy_Look
---
Dex: My note. "Circle YES or YES." Smooth.
===
title: Item_frisbee_Look
---
Dex: A neon frisbee. Good for throwing at things you can't reach.
===
title: Item_sunglasses_Look
---
Dex: Dark shades, recently worn by a statue. Very mysterious.
===
title: Item_bookmark_Look
---
Dex: Ivy's bookmark, with a pressed daisy. She kept her place in her life story with this.
===

title: A1_UnionSign_Look
---
Dex: A signpost: STUDENT UNION, with an arrow. Underneath someone wrote "food" and drew a little possum.
===
title: A1_UnionSign_Use
---
<<go student_union from_campus>>
===

title: A1_Union_Enter
---
<<if not flagged("a1_union_intro")>>
    Dex: The Student Union cafeteria after dark. Chairs on tables, a humming soda fountain, and one grill still sizzling.
    Doreen: We're closed, sugar. Unless you're staff. Or the possum.
    Dex: The possum?
    <<flag a1_union_intro>>
<<endif>>
===
title: A1_UnionExit_Look
---
Dex: The doors back out to the quad.
===
title: A1_UnionExit_Use
---
<<go campus from_union>>
===
title: A1_Menu_Look
---
Dex: TONIGHT: Onion Soup. Mystery Loaf. Possum Waffle, MASCOT ONLY. Underneath, in chalk: "No, you can't be the mascot. Love, Doreen."
===
title: A1_Menu_Use
---
Dex: I'd order something, but the only thing on this menu I can afford is the chalk.
===
title: A1_Grill_Look
---
Dex: A flat-top grill, a waffle iron shaped like a possum, and a pot of onion soup big enough to bathe in.
===
title: A1_Grill_Use
---
Doreen: Hands off my grill, sugar. Nobody touches it but me and the health inspector, and he only touched it once.
===
title: A1_Fountain_Look
---
Dex: The soda fountain. A sign says OUT OF ORDER. A second sign says WE MEAN IT. A third sign just says DOREEN.
===
title: A1_Fountain_Use
---
Dex: I press the lever. It gurgles, coughs, and spits out a single ice cube. Then it makes a noise like it's judging me.
===
title: A1_Fountain_Dollar
---
Dex: There's no slot for money. There's barely a slot for hope. Doreen's cooler is the only cold soda in this building.
===
title: A1_Bulletin_Look
---
Dex: A poster: "STACKS SLAM. Tonight, upper library stacks. Champion: Percival Thorne, 37 wins, 0 losses. Come and lose with dignity."
Dex: Next to it: "LOST: Pokey's left glove. If found, do NOT smell it."
===
title: A1_Bulletin_Use
---
Dex: Somebody stapled a flyer to another flyer about not stapling flyers. I respect the chaos.
===

title: A1_Doreen_Look
---
<<if flagged("a1_got_waffle")>>
    Dex: Doreen, humming, scrubbing the possum waffle iron like it's a family heirloom.
<<else>>
    Dex: The night cook. Hairnet, giant spatula, forearms that could flip a car. Her name tag says DOREEN.
<<endif>>
===
title: A1_Doreen_Talk
---
<<if not flagged("a1_met_doreen")>>
    Doreen: Grill's closed, sugar. After nine I cook for staff and for Pokey, and you are neither.
    Dex: Who's Pokey?
    Doreen: Pokey the Possum! Our mascot. Only one on this campus who ever says thank you.
    <<flag a1_met_doreen>>
<<elseif flagged("a1_got_waffle")>>
    Doreen: Back again, sugar? My Pokey ate good tonight. Did you see? Two hands on the waffle. Precious.
<<else>>
    Doreen: Still closed, sugar. Still not a possum.
<<endif>>
<<jump A1_Doreen_Menu>>
===
title: A1_Doreen_Menu
---
-> Ask what's good here <<if not flagged("a1_cb_onion")>>
    Doreen: My onion soup. Makes grown men weep.
    Doreen: And it's still got more layers than any boy on this campus.
    Dex: (Ha. "So does onion soup, and it has more layers." Filing that one away.)
    <<flag a1_cb_onion>>
    <<jump A1_Doreen_Menu>>
-> Ask about the onion soup again <<if flagged("a1_cb_onion")>>
    Doreen: Simmered since Tuesday. Which Tuesday, I couldn't tell you.
    <<jump A1_Doreen_Menu>>
-> Ask for a possum waffle <<if not flagged("a1_got_waffle")>>
    Doreen: Possum waffles are for Pokey. It's in his contract. Free waffle, every shift, extra whipped cream.
    Doreen: You put on a possum head and grunt at me nicely, then we'll talk. Ha! As if.
    <<jump A1_Doreen_Menu>>
-> Ask for a soda <<if not has("soda") and not flagged("lacey_has_drink") and not flagged("made_hooch")>>
    Doreen: Fountain's busted. I've got the last cold cans in my cooler, and they're for staff and for Pokey.
    <<jump A1_Doreen_Menu>>
-> Ask about Pokey <<if not flagged("a1_got_waffle")>>
    Doreen: Sweetest possum on earth. Never talks, always waves. I'd adopt him if he weren't a, you know, possum.
    Dex: (She thinks Pokey is real. She does not know Kyle is inside.)
    <<jump A1_Doreen_Menu>>
-> Ask about Boomer <<if flagged("a1_boomer_dream") and not flagged("a1_boomer_moved")>>
    Doreen: The big sleepwalker? He shuffled in last week, pyjamas and all, and stood at my counter snoring at the waffle iron.
    Doreen: I nearly gave him one. Then I remembered the contract.
    <<jump A1_Doreen_Menu>>
-> Say goodnight
    Doreen: Night, sugar. Wipe your feet on the way out. I mean it. Look at that floor.
===
title: A1_Doreen_GivePossumHead
---
<<if flagged("a1_got_waffle")>>
    Doreen: Pokey, honey, you already ate. Don't be greedy, it's not cute. It's a little cute.
<<else>>
    Dex: I pull Pokey's head over mine. It smells like pine trees and old secrets. I waddle to the counter and grunt politely.
    Doreen: POKEY! My favourite customer! Sit, sit. One possum waffle, extra whipped cream.
    Doreen: And a cold soda from my cooler. Don't tell the students.
    Dex: (muffled) Hrrm. Thank you.
    Doreen: Did you hear that? He said thank you. Nobody says thank you.
    <<give possum_waffle>>
    <<give soda>>
    <<flag a1_got_waffle>>
    Kyle: (from his table) Psst. Break's over, buddy. Head, please.
    Dex: I slip the head back to Kyle under the table. Doreen never notices. A possum waffle AND a soda. Not bad for a guy with no meal plan.
    <<take possum_head>>
<<endif>>
===
title: A1_Doreen_GiveFreshener
---
Doreen: Sugar, this kitchen smells like onions and victory. It does not need a tree.
===

title: A1_Kyle_Look
---
<<if flagged("a1_kyle_has_freshener")>>
    Dex: Kyle, in the bottom half of a possum suit, smelling like a forest. A happy, sweaty forest.
<<else>>
    Dex: A guy in a giant grey possum suit, head off, sweating into a cafeteria table. The head sits next to him, staring at me.
<<endif>>
===
title: A1_Kyle_Talk
---
<<if not flagged("a1_met_kyle")>>
    Kyle: Don't look at me. Pokey is supposed to be magic. Kids can't know there's a Kyle inside.
    Dex: Your secret's safe with me, Kyle.
    Kyle: I'm on break. Twenty minutes to breathe air that doesn't smell like possum armpit.
    <<flag a1_met_kyle>>
<<elseif flagged("a1_kyle_has_freshener")>>
    Kyle: My man! I smell like a national park. The kids are going to love it.
<<else>>
    Kyle: Still on break. Still sweaty. Still Kyle.
<<endif>>
<<jump A1_Kyle_Menu>>
===
title: A1_Kyle_Menu
---
-> Ask about being the mascot <<if not flagged("a1_cb_crash")>>
    Kyle: In this suit, nobody can take their eyes off me.
    Kyle: It's the same reason nobody can look away from a car crash.
    Dex: (Ooh. "People can't look away from car crashes either." Filing that one away.)
    <<flag a1_cb_crash>>
    <<jump A1_Kyle_Menu>>
-> Ask about the smell <<if not flagged("a1_kyle_has_freshener")>>
    Kyle: Fourteen years of possum sweat. Every Pokey before me left a little of himself in there.
    Kyle: I'd give anything for something that smells like a forest. A pine forest. Even one tree.
    <<jump A1_Kyle_Menu>>
-> Ask to borrow the possum head <<if not flagged("a1_kyle_has_freshener")>>
    Kyle: And let someone else smell it? That's cruel.
    Kyle: Okay, honestly? Make this suit smell better and you can wear the head for the rest of my break.
    <<jump A1_Kyle_Menu>>
-> Ask about Doreen <<if not flagged("a1_got_waffle")>>
    Kyle: Doreen thinks Pokey is real. She feeds him free waffles. I've never had the heart to tell her.
    Kyle: Honestly, anybody in that head could get a waffle. She doesn't check. She just sees possum.
    <<jump A1_Kyle_Menu>>
-> Ask about the Talent Round
    Kyle: Pokey does the halftime dance. Last year I fell off the stage. They called it my best work.
    <<jump A1_Kyle_Menu>>
-> Let him enjoy his break
    Kyle: Thanks, man. If you see any kids, I'm not here.
===
title: A1_Kyle_GiveFreshener
---
<<if flagged("a1_kyle_has_freshener")>>
    Kyle: I already smell like a forest, man.
<<else>>
    Kyle: Is that... Alpine Morning? Give it here.
    Dex: He hangs the pine tree inside the possum head and takes a deep breath.
    Kyle: Oh, that's beautiful. That's the best thing that's ever happened inside this head.
    Kyle: Deal's a deal. Wear it for the rest of my break. Just don't take it outside. Kids.
    <<take pine_freshener>>
    <<give possum_head>>
    <<flag a1_kyle_has_freshener>>
<<endif>>
===
title: A1_Kyle_GiveSoda
---
Kyle: Cold soda? Tempting, but it doesn't fix the suit. Nothing you drink fixes the suit.
===

title: Item_possum_head_Look
---
Dex: Pokey the Possum's head. Big eyes, bigger teeth, and now a pine tree hanging inside it. Doreen only feeds Pokey.
===
title: Item_possum_waffle_Look
---
Dex: A possum-shaped waffle with whipped cream ears. It's not for me. Do not eat the possum, Dex.
===

